      "And she is not the only one.",
      "At that exact second, the whole palace falls asleep. The king and the queen, who have just returned, fall asleep in the ballroom. The soldiers fall asleep on the walls. The horses fall asleep in the stables. The dogs fall asleep in the yard.",
